  "text": "beUI Native is free — Pro mobile blocks and screens are in presale from $99\n\nReserve\nbeUI Pro for mobile\nbeUI\nComponents\nBlocks\nAgents\nCharts\nPlayground\nSponsors\nLight theme\nLight theme\nDark theme\nDark theme\nSystem theme\nSystem theme\n1.9k\nGet Pro\n\nINTRO\n\nHome\nCHARTS\n14\nSankey Chart\nNEW\nTreemap\nCandlestick Chart\nDonut Chart\nVolume Profile\nStatus Bar\nComposition Chart\nFunnel Chart\nLiquidity Heatmap\nBump Chart\nOrder Book\nHeat Calendar\nReturns Calendar\nPrice Target Fan\nCharts\nReturns Calendar\nReturns Calendar\nCopy Page\n\nComposable monthly returns calendar with Grid and Tooltip parts, controlled month or year selections, and compounded totals. Supply your own years and monthly percentages.\n\nPreview\nPreview\nPreview\nUsage\nUsage\nCode\nCode\nJ\nF\nM\nA\nM\nJ\nJ\nA\nS\nO\nN\nD\nYear\n’21\n4\n-4\n6\n7\n5\n5\n+14%\n’22\n-4\n-7\n−14%\n’23\n5\n5\n6\n4\n5\n5\n+32%\n’24\n4\n4\n−6%\n’25\n4\n5\n-5\n−8%\nInstall\n\nAdd it with the shadcn CLI, or copy the source manually.\n\nCLI\nCLI\nManual\nManual\nbun\nbun\nnpm\nnpm\npnpm\npnpm\nyarn\nyarn\n$ bunx --bun shadcn add @beui/\nreturns-calendar\nreturns-calendar\nAPI Reference\nReturnsCalendar\nyears?\nnumber[]\n\nRow labels, one per row of `returns`.\n\n—\nreturns?\nnumber[][]\n\n`returns[year][month]` in percent, twelve months per row.\n\n—\nclassName?\nstring\n—\nselection?\nReturnsCalendarSelection | null\n—\ndefaultSelection?\nReturnsCalendarSelection | null\n—\nonSelectionChange?\n((selection: ReturnsCalendarSelection | null) => void)\n—\nReturnsCalendarGrid\nclassName?\nstring\n—\nReturnsCalendarTooltip\nclassName?\nstring\n—\nRelated components\nHeat Calendar\n\nComposable activity calendar with Grid, Legend, and Tooltip parts, controlled range selection, and UTC calendar dates. Supply weekly intensities to visualize activity and total a selected span.\n\nPrice Target Fan\n\nComposable price target chart with Header, Plot, SVG, Axes, History, Targets, Now, Cursor, and Tooltip parts. Supply dated price history and targets; scrub with a pointer or keyboard and customize the active readout.\n\nTreemap\n\nProportional tiles that morph with your data, with value and share tooltips.\n\nAbout Returns Calendar\n\nReturns Calendar is a React heatmap of monthly investment returns, laid out as years by months with a compounded total for each year. Cells tint toward a gain or loss color by magnitude, spring in on a diagonal wave with Framer Motion, and show a tooltip with the exact return. Clicking one month and then another compounds the return across the span, and the year column selects whole years the same way. It composes from ReturnsCalendarGrid, ReturnsCalendarTooltip and the useReturnsCalendar hook.\n\nWhen to use it\nA fund, portfolio or trading strategy page shows monthly performance across several years.\nA backtest report needs readers to check the compounded return between any two months.\nAn investor dashboard compares calendar years side by side with their total returns.\nAccessibility\n\nEvery month and year total is a button whose label reads the period and signed percentage, span ends report a pressed state, and the focused cell is linked to the tooltip with aria-describedby. Escape clears the selection. Hover lifts only run on devices that can hover. With reduced motion enabled, the entrance wave, hover lift and year row replay are removed and only fades remain.\n\nFAQ\nHow do I build a monthly returns table in React?\nPass ReturnsCalendar a years array of row labels and a returns array shaped returns[year][month] in percent, twelve months per row. Missing months count as zero so later positions never shift.\nHow is the span return calculated?\nReturns are compounded, not added. Each month multiplies by one plus its return, so a span shows the real growth across those months.\nCan I change the tooltip content?\nYes. Pass a function as the child of ReturnsCalendarTooltip. It receives the label, value and note for the current cell or span.\nContributed by\nSavva\n\nUpdated Oct 18, 2026\n\nbeUI\nPro\nLimited Offer\n\n300+ blocks and premium motion components for React and Next.js.\n\n$179 lifetime access\n\nExplore beUI Pro\nSponsors\n\nDIAMOND\n\nTracwell\n\nVisitor insights for growth\n\nIllos\n\nAnimated illustrations for product sites\n\nBecome a sponsor",
